+## 2026-11-18: `list --category`
+
+Tool: Claude Code in the terminal.
+
+### What the AI did
+
+- **Wrote the whole feature at my request.** It added an optional `category` argument to `ExpenseStore.list_all` (filtered in SQL with `WHERE ? IS NULL OR category = ?`) and a `--category` option to the `list` subcommand. With no matches it prints `No expenses in category '<name>'.`
+- **Wrote the four new tests:** two in `tests/test_storage.py` (filters by category; an unknown category returns `[]`) and two in `tests/test_cli.py` (shows only that category; message when nothing matches).
